infographic compare-quadrant-quarter-simple-card
data
  title Order x deadline are orthogonal — only one cell loses nothing
  desc Rows: closing order (reverse-dependency vs concurrent). Columns: does the drain finish before the grace period. The guardian rescues only the timing axis, never the ordering.
  compares
    - label Order right, drains: clean exit
    - label Order right, hangs: guardian exit
    - label Order wrong, drains: dead-pool 502
    - label Order wrong, hangs: lost anyway
theme
  palette #10b981 #f59e0b #f43f5e #ec4899
